{"id":"94da30522fe93e7f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-splitting-procedure.md","title":"无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","display":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-splitting-procedure","aliases":["20-df-splitting-procedure"],"display":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机","chapter":"12","section":"12.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）","source_printed_pages":[200],"source_pdf_pages":[230],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-splitting-procedure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-splitting-procedure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-splitting-procedure — 无 oracle 的 e-分裂自动机"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>230</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 是函数树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的程序索引；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{j,s}(\\beta)\">\\(T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\)</span> 表示对有限串编码的阶段模拟；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{ran}(T)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；有限见证按阶段、再按代码排列。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting-procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\n\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\ [\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)&lt;s\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z&lt;s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\rho}(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\tau}(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\simeq\\mu s\\ \\exists\\rho,\\tau\\ R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau),\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\simeq\\min_{\\operatorname{code}}\\{(\\rho,\\tau):R_{j,e}(\\nu,t_{j,e}(\\nu),\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nS=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e):\\quad S(\\varnothing)=\\sigma,\\quad\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\simeq\\pi_i(q_{j,e}(S(\\alpha)))\\quad(i&lt;2).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}splitting-procedure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nR_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau)\\Longleftrightarrow\\nu\\prec\\rho\\land\\nu\\prec\\tau\n\\land\\operatorname{code}(\\rho),\\operatorname{code}(\\tau)&lt;s\\\\\n\\land\\exists\\beta,\\gamma\\ [\\operatorname{code}(\\beta),\\operatorname{code}(\\gamma)&lt;s\\land T_{j,s}(\\beta)\\downarrow=\\rho\\land T_{j,s}(\\gamma)\\downarrow=\\tau]\\\\\n\\land\\exists x,y,z&lt;s\\ [\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\rho}(x)\\downarrow=y\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{\\tau}(x)\\downarrow=z\\land y\\ne z],\\\\\nt_{j,e}(\\nu)\\simeq\\mu s\\ \\exists\\rho,\\tau\\ R_{j,e}(\\nu,s,\\rho,\\tau),\\\\\nq_{j,e}(\\nu)\\simeq\\min_{\\operatorname{code}}\\{(\\rho,\\tau):R_{j,e}(\\nu,t_{j,e}(\\nu),\\rho,\\tau)\\},\\\\\nS=\\operatorname{Sp}(T,\\sigma,e):\\quad S(\\varnothing)=\\sigma,\\quad\nS(\\alpha^\\frown i)\\simeq\\pi_i(q_{j,e}(S(\\alpha)))\\quad(i&lt;2).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定阶段的所有见证检查都有限可判定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是普通不定搜索，未找到见证时发散。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min_{\\operatorname{code}}\">\\(\\min_{\\operatorname{code}}\\)</span> 对该阶段的非空有限见证集取最小编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0,\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_0,\\pi_1\\)</span> 分别取两个分量。在部分组合中先等待父值，保证严格按域串长度递归；两兄弟由同一见证决定。程序无 oracle，只有索引、有限串和数参数。必须区分该阶段有限见证集与整个程序将来可能枚举的值域。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 12.3.1；Remark 12.3.2（阶段搜索展开）；印刷页 200；PDF 第 230 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a