itting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-restriction]]；see [[20-lem-splitting-totality]]；see [[20-lem-color-inheritance]]。"}],"outgoing":["f2458da73bd8fe19","01d522a0b0df3738","4ef1aee16db6b308","8ba6597a854c206f"]}